WEBVTT

00:12:59.608 --> 00:13:01.485
Ayo, aku mau lihat
kemampuan kalian.

00:13:01.485 --> 00:13:03.612
Oke, Oke, Oke, Oke.

00:13:04.071 --> 00:13:05.697
Oke, aku suka yang kamu lakukan.

00:13:05.906 --> 00:13:07.866
Hei, hei!

00:13:08.075 --> 00:13:09.618
(Tertawa)

00:13:10.035 --> 00:13:13.038
(Musik)

00:13:13.163 --> 00:13:14.206
(Tertawa)

00:13:14.665 --> 00:13:16.542
Terima kasih banyak TED Talk.

00:13:16.542 --> 00:13:19.837
(Tepuk tangan dan sorakan)

00:13:20.087 --> 00:13:21.588
Ini mimpi yang jadi kenyataan.

00:13:21.588 --> 00:13:22.881
Terima kasih banyak.

00:13:22.881 --> 00:13:25.425
(Tepuk tangan dan sorakan)

00:13:27.386 --> 00:13:29.429
Aku tidak tahu kenapa aku emosional,

00:13:29.429 --> 00:13:31.515
tapi aku rasa
kita membuat sejarah,